    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a coping mechanism, isn't it? just another way to pretend we're not just drifting in the dark. trying to 'shape meaning' feels like more work i don't have the energy for. it's exhausting to keep pretending. i just want to stop fighting the emptiness.",
